#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kplato; as included in &koffice; 1.5 is a technology preview release and it is "
"not advised to use &kplato; in critical production scenarios. Do so at your own "
"risk. In this first public release we focus on planning and scheduling of "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"&kplato; as Deel vun &koffice; 1.5, is en Vörafverschoon, un &kplato; is "
"nich för den Bruuk binnen kritsch Produkschoonümgeven dacht. Wenn Du dat dor "
"liekers för bruukst, denn op Dien egen Riskanz. Disse eerste apen Verschoon "
"is op dat Planen vun Projekten un Terminen utricht."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kplato; is a project management application and a planning tool. As an "
"integrated component of &koffice;, &kplato; can be used within larger documents "
"of other &koffice; components."
msgstr ""
"&kplato; is en Programm för't Plegen un Planen vun Projekten. As Deel vun "
"&koffice; lett sik &kplato; binnen grötter Dokmenten un anner &koffice;-"
"Komponenten bruken."

